failure_location.quote:
Under the time step restriction $\max_k(|v_k|) \Delta t \leq \Delta x$, the fully discrete DLRA scheme \eqref{alg:DLRA} is numerically stable in the $\mathscr{H}$-norm, i.e
\begin{align*}
\Vert \mathbf{f}^{n+1}  \Vert_{\mathscr{H}}^2 \leq \Vert \mathbf{f}^n \Vert_{\mathscr{H}}^2.
\end{align*}
